   "line": [
    "Bg7"
   ],
   "spoken": "And here's the payoff of the double fianchetto — the moment Black plays Bg7 the bishop is undefended, and with both knights gone the two bishops would stare each other down. That's the seed of a discovery.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Two undefended bishops facing each other down a diagonal signal a discovered-attack tactic."
